      "text": "\n19 months\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n20 months\n",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "\n21 months\n",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "\n18 months",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{array}{ccccccc}1 & 2 & 3 & 4 & 5 & 6 & \\ldots \\ldots . \\\\ 200 & 200 & 200 & 240 & 280 & \\ldots \\ldots . & \\ldots \\ldots \\ldots\\end{array}$\nSum $=11040$\n$120+80+160+40+200+240+\\ldots=11040$\n$\\frac{n}{2}[2 a+(n-1) d]+80+40=11040$\n$\\frac{n}{2}[240+(n-1) 40]=10920$\n$n[6+n-1]=546$\n$n(n+5)=546$\n$n=21$"
  }
